#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0163 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS. Columns STUDYID(Char), USUBJID(Char), AEDECOD(Char), BTOXGR(Char). ONE row: `CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | GRADE1`. This is the FIRING shape (BTOXGR present, ATOXGR absent), so the ONLY thing that can stop the rule is the scope gate: OCCURRENCE DATA STRUCTURE is outside `Scope.Data_Structures.Include: [BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE]`. Precedent pmda/PMDA-AD0157/PMDA-AD0157-skipped_occds_structure-ADAE.cdt. Deliberately NO PARAMCD/AVAL column, so the declaration and the column heuristic agree on OCCDS and the fixture does not depend on the Fix #154 precedence tie-break. The declaration wins over the column heuristic (Fix #154); `#library` is its carrier."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col BTOXGR type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | GRADE1
